  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.3 Dependency Fix (2026-02-08)\n\nCHANGED:\n- BlazorEmo is now a separate NuGet dependency instead of embedded\n- This allows independent updates and use of BlazorEmo in other projects\n- Users installing BlazorRTE will automatically get BlazorEmo 1.0.0\n\nTECHNICAL:\n- Changed from ProjectReference to PackageReference for BlazorEmo\n- No functional changes - all v1.1.2 features remain the same\n- Package size reduced (BlazorEmo no longer embedded)\n\nBENEFITS:\n- BlazorEmo can be updated independently\n- Other projects can use BlazorEmo separately\n- Clear dependency graph on NuGet.org\n- Proper package attribution\n\nNOTES:\n- This is a non-breaking change\n- BlazorEmo 1.0.0 installs automatically via NuGet dependency resolution\n- All 51 features from v1.1.2 remain unchanged\n\nPrevious release (v1.1.2) features:\n- Emoji Picker with 1800+ searchable emojis\n- Emoji Autocomplete (:smile shortcuts)\n- 27 Keyboard Shortcuts (Ctrl+B, Ctrl+K, Ctrl+Shift+E, etc.)\n- Dynamic font size button\n- Link button fixes (prompts for URL, validates selection)\n- Mouse click fixes for all 5 pickers\n- Complete ARIA implementation (WAI-ARIA 1.2)\n- 54 unit tests with 100% pass rate\n\nSee: https://github.com/simscon1/BlazorRTE/blob/master/Docs/CHANGELOG.md",
